+# Automation diagnosis tooling (scratch; diagnosis patch only)
+
+These are the scripts `AUTOMATION-DIAGNOSIS.md` was measured with. Each one hard-codes the
+diagnosis's scratch root (`.../scratchpad/automation-diag`) and worktree path, so edit both
+before reuse.
+
+* `gen_docs.py REPO OUT`: the V8 harness's session documents.
+* `build_web.sh NAME`: builds `src-NAME` (a `git archive` of the tree plus a prototype, its switch
+  compiled as a constant) into `t-web-NAME` with the delivery recipe.
+* `build_check.sh NAME...`: the same, then the `KERNEL_ROSTER` gate on the result.
+* `run_web.sh SUBJECTS ARMS A.wasm [B.wasm ...]`: the timed V8 run, under the lock, on cpu 31.
+* `web_auto.mjs`: the harness itself. `DIGEST=N` makes it an output-identity check instead of a
+  timer.
+* `build_native.sh` and `run_native.sh BINARY rows`: the native console harness
+  (`tools/console-workload/tests/automation_diag.rs`).
+* `crate_test.sh PKG release FILTER` and `run_identity_eq.sh`: the prototype differentials, which
+  are untimed.
