+//! Automation cost diagnosis (2026-09-27). Diagnosis patch only; never merged.
+//!
+//! Console-level isolates of the EQ, the compressor and the limiter under parameter automation,
+//! through the production live-console control path (`SessionRuntime::push_parameter`, one Point
+//! per block, drained at the top of the next block). Every push is outside the clock.
+//!
+//! `cargo test --release -p console-workload --test automation_diag -- --ignored --nocapture
+//! --test-threads 1 rows` with `AUTO_DIAG_WIDTHS=8,4` `AUTO_DIAG_SUBJECTS=eq_gain,...`
+//! `AUTO_DIAG_ROUNDS=6` `AUTO_DIAG_BLOCKS=800`.
